  "title": "Leftover Ham Bone Soup",
  "description": "A leftover ham bone and a few pantry staples are all you need to whip up this tasty potato and bean soup. Just let it simmer while you prepare the rest of your meal.",
  "authors": [
    "noellemarie"
  ],
  "date_published": "2011-11-04T12:53:49-04:00",
